      "content": "Integrating ESG metrics is now essential for modern companies to attract sustainable investment and ensure long-term resilience against regulatory and market pressures. While traditional financial reports still dominate, boards that proactively adopt holistic ESG data risk missing critical insights into operational risks and stakeholder expectations. Given your sector's exposure to global scrutiny, a balanced approach that prioritizes clear financial performance while systematically adding key ESG indicators will better position your company for future growth and compliance.",
