    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "thanks. some of the board members are pretty skeptical though. they're mostly old school and think that our only real responsibility is to maximize profits for the shareholders and that messing around with social or environmental goals just distracts from the bottom line and hurts our fiduciary duty. how should i address that specific concern in the summary?",
